00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:44,557
* But he's saved by editing

451
00:18:44,591 --> 00:18:48,094
* Just a tweak of the nipple
sends him on his way *

452
00:18:48,127 --> 00:18:50,830
* A pumpkin head
and a rocket pack *

453
00:18:50,863 --> 00:18:53,300
* He'll save the day

454
00:18:53,333 --> 00:18:56,169
-* His laboratory
is a boxing ring *

455
00:18:56,203 --> 00:18:58,638
* When bad guys come
to mix it up *

456
00:18:58,671 --> 00:19:01,140
* Somebody always
