457
00:19:01,174 --> 00:19:03,643
* And Cody has to fix it up

458
00:19:03,676 --> 00:19:07,079
* He drinks his tea
at Al's Cafe *

459
00:19:07,113 --> 00:19:10,016
* And flies along on wires

460
00:19:10,049 --> 00:19:11,651
* He beats up crooks

461
00:19:11,684 --> 00:19:13,085
* And flies with hooks

462
00:19:13,119 --> 00:19:15,888
* And puts out forest fires

463
00:19:15,922 --> 00:19:17,089
-* Bad guys, beware

464
00:19:17,123 --> 00:19:18,124
* Cody is there

465
00:19:18,157 --> 00:19:19,292
* You'll like his hair

466
00:19:19,326 --> 00:19:20,627
* It's under his helmet

467
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:22,895
* 'Cause we couldn't think
of a good rhyme *

468
00:19:22,929 --> 00:19:25,265
* And that's the end of the
"Commando Cody" theme song *

469
00:19:25,298 --> 00:19:29,001
* So sit right back and with
a will of granite and watch *

