00:19:45,718 --> 00:19:48,421
-You missed!
-Aimed too quick.

479
00:19:48,455 --> 00:19:49,556
Turn the truck around.

480
00:19:49,589 --> 00:19:51,123
I'll get another shot at him.
-Right.

481
00:19:51,157 --> 00:19:52,158
-Why don't they just turn
the gun around?

482
00:19:52,191 --> 00:19:53,560
-Because it'd shoot right
through

483
00:19:53,593 --> 00:19:54,761
